WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.473 --> 00:00:17.882
The gorzog crept closer, growling and spitting foul-smelling mucus.

2
00:00:17.902 --> 00:00:25.327
"Gorzogs are the most dangerous creatures in this part of Terrica," Mellis warned Zann and Perda, her voice

3
00:00:25.527 --> 00:00:32.412
shaking. "They're totally fearless and will eat anything—or anyone—they can grab."

4
00:00:33.164 --> 00:00:37.308
The gorzog was ugly, but Zann didn't think it looked that scary.

5
00:00:37.988 --> 00:00:39.289
It wasn't even very big.

6
00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:45.455
But Zann's travels to other worlds had taught him that creatures didn't have to look scary to be

7
00:00:45.615 --> 00:00:46.556
very dangerous.

8
00:00:46.576 --> 00:00:54.502
"Find a weapon," Vilkor said, grabbing one of the shovels the kids had left by the well.

9
00:00:55.503 --> 00:00:57.205
Mellis darted toward another shovel.

10
00:00:57.925 --> 00:01:00.828
At that moment the gorzog leaped in the same direction.

11
00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:04.807
Its hind legs propelled it farther than Zann expected.

12
00:01:05.427 --> 00:01:09.391
It landed in front of Mellis, who screamed and tried to grab the shovel.

13
00:01:09.971 --> 00:01:12.734
The gorzog blocked her, growling loudly.

14
00:01:12.754 --> 00:01:14.795
"I'm coming!"

15
00:01:15.216 --> 00:01:16.837
Perda cried, rushing forward.

16
00:01:16.857 --> 00:01:18.419
"No, stop!"

17
00:01:18.819 --> 00:01:19.560
Vilkor cried.

18
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:23.143
"It's too late for my niece, but we can still save ourselves!"

19
00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:26.285
Zann shot the man a disgusted look.

20
00:01:26.846 --> 00:01:28.447
"He isn't even going to try to rescue her!"

21
00:01:28.727 --> 00:01:29.128
he thought.

22
00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:31.541
Perda reached Mellis' side.

23
00:01:31.561 --> 00:01:35.082
"Shield!" she shouted, clapping her hands.

24
00:01:35.983 --> 00:01:40.525
A translucent, glowing, green wall appeared between the girls and the gorzog.

25
00:01:41.165 --> 00:01:46.007
The creature lunged forward, hit the shield, and fell back with an irritated shriek.

26
00:01:49.308 --> 00:01:52.950
Zann gulped as the frustrated gorzog turned to face him.

27
00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:57.492
He thought about creating a Shield spell to protect himself and the two adults.

28
00:01:58.156 --> 00:02:03.038
Before he could, Zing flew past him, shooting fire in the gorzog's direction.

29
00:02:03.058 --> 00:02:04.238
"Go, Zing!"

30
00:02:04.578 --> 00:02:07.419
Zann shouted as the gorzog flinched at the flames.

31
00:02:08.079 --> 00:02:09.860
Perda and Mellis looked hopeful.

32
00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:12.481
But the two adults looked perplexed.

33
00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:14.941
"A flying chupo?"

34
00:02:15.441 --> 00:02:17.462
Zira muttered, narrowing her eyes.

35
00:02:17.482 --> 00:02:23.284
"Impossible!" "Is that chupo shooting fire out of its mouth?"

36
00:02:24.092 --> 00:02:28.416
Vilkor scratched his head, seeming to forget about the gorzog for a moment.

37
00:02:29.256 --> 00:02:33.980
The gorzog crouched low to the ground, tracking Zing with its yellowish eyes.

38
00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:39.465
Suddenly it jumped up and spat a huge wad of goo at the little dragon.

39
00:02:40.586 --> 00:02:43.268
"Zing! No!"

40
00:02:43.768 --> 00:02:46.170
Zann cried as his pet fell to the ground.

41
00:02:46.991 --> 00:02:51.214
The dragon tried to free his legs and wings from the gorzog's sticky spit.

42
00:02:53.396 --> 00:02:54.437
"Zing! Try singing!"

43
00:02:54.897 --> 00:02:55.477
Perda called.

44
00:02:55.497 --> 00:02:57.498
"Good idea," Zann said.

45
00:02:57.518 --> 00:02:59.299
"Sing, little buddy, sing!"

46
00:02:59.999 --> 00:03:05.281
He wasn't sure if the fire whistler's distinctive song would work the same way it did in Magica.

47
00:03:06.222 --> 00:03:11.024
There, it hypnotized most creatures, though humans and other dragons were immune.

48
00:03:11.724 --> 00:03:13.205
Zing wriggled and writhed.

49
00:03:13.765 --> 00:03:18.627
His red tongue flicked in and out as he tried to clear the sticky spit from his snout.

50
00:03:19.387 --> 00:03:20.648
Zann held his breath.

51
00:03:21.408 --> 00:03:25.812
The gorzog was creeping closer, eyes locked on the helpless dragon.

52
00:03:27.153 --> 00:03:30.175
Finally Zing managed to whistle a weak tune.

53
00:03:30.856 --> 00:03:36.581
The gorzog stopped, though Zann couldn't tell if it was because it was hypnotized or merely surprised.

54
00:03:37.261 --> 00:03:41.985
Out of the corner of his eye, Zann noticed that Perda had dismissed the Shield spell.

55
00:03:42.566 --> 00:03:47.009
Mellis was backing away, but Perda was tiptoeing closer to the gorzog.

56
00:03:47.590 --> 00:03:48.691
"What is she doing?"

57
00:03:49.131 --> 00:03:49.792
Vilkor said.

58
00:03:50.316 --> 00:03:52.257
"The gorzog is distracted by that chupo.

59
00:03:52.877 --> 00:03:54.457
This is our chance to run away!"

60
00:03:54.477 --> 00:03:58.678
"Or perhaps we could use magic to get away," Zira said.

61
00:03:58.698 --> 00:04:00.259
"What did you call it?

62
00:04:00.859 --> 00:04:01.499
A Zap?"

63
00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.740
Zann ignored both of them.

64
00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:06.381
"Sing louder, Zing," he said.

65
00:04:06.941 --> 00:04:11.202
He wasn't sure what Perda had in mind, but he planned to back her up if he could.

66
00:04:11.942 --> 00:04:17.704
He took a step closer to the gorzog, hoping to distract its attention away from her and Zing.

67
00:04:18.304 --> 00:04:20.206
The gorzog growled at Zann.

68
00:04:20.926 --> 00:04:23.248
It stared at him and then at Zing.

69
00:04:24.109 --> 00:04:27.612
It seemed to be trying to decide which prey looked tastier.

70
00:04:28.773 --> 00:04:30.454
Suddenly Perda leaped forward.

71
00:04:31.075 --> 00:04:35.779
Zann guessed she'd used magic to propel herself farther than she could have jumped on her own.

72
00:04:36.499 --> 00:04:38.301
She landed right next to the gorzog.

73
00:04:38.321 --> 00:04:40.423
"Perda!" Mellis cried.

74
00:04:40.443 --> 00:04:41.704
"What are you doing?"

75
00:04:42.444 --> 00:04:46.348
Perda didn't look around or even flinch as the gorzog spun to face her.

76
00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:51.763
She reached out and tapped the monster on the head, while rubbing her side with her other hand.

77
00:04:51.783 --> 00:04:54.524
"Shackle," she said loudly.

78
00:04:55.305 --> 00:04:57.106
The gorzog tried to leap at her.

79
00:04:57.686 --> 00:05:03.289
But as it did, magical shackles appeared on its legs, binding all four limbs together.

80
00:05:03.889 --> 00:05:08.232
It flopped forward, its gnashing teeth only an inch from Perda.

81
00:05:08.252 --> 00:05:11.734
"Whoa!" Zann laughed and hurried forward.

82
00:05:11.754 --> 00:05:13.735
"That was awesome!"

83
00:05:13.755 --> 00:05:17.906
"Thanks." Perda glanced down at the gorzog.

84
00:05:17.926 --> 00:05:21.969
"Wow, this thing is even uglier up close."

85
00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:27.253
Zann kneeled beside Zing, who was still struggling against the sticky spit.

86
00:05:27.273 --> 00:05:29.195
"Hold still, buddy," he said.

87
00:05:30.115 --> 00:05:34.739
He rubbed his hands together and used a Cleaning spell to remove the disgusting goo.

88
00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:39.963
Zing immediately leaped into the air and flew around the helpless gorzog.

89
00:05:40.484 --> 00:05:45.548
The dragon spat angry flames, though Zann noticed he didn't get too close to the creature.

90
00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:49.202
"Quite impressive, young lady," Vilkor said.

91
00:05:49.762 --> 00:05:51.963
He hurried forward to give Mellis a hug.

92
00:05:52.844 --> 00:05:54.284
"I'm glad you're safe.

93
00:05:54.665 --> 00:05:56.586
I don't know what I'd do without you, Mellis."

94
00:05:57.846 --> 00:05:59.587
Zann stepped closer to Perda.

95
00:06:00.067 --> 00:06:02.649
"He wasn't worried about that a few seconds ago," he whispered.

96
00:06:02.669 --> 00:06:06.251
"He was ready to run away and let her become the gorzog's lunch!"

97
00:06:06.271 --> 00:06:11.874
"That's why we have to make sure she knows how to do magic before we leave," Perda whispered

98
00:06:11.914 --> 00:06:13.315
back. "Okay.

99
00:06:13.535 --> 00:06:15.596
But how are we going to get her away from those two?"

100
00:06:16.348 --> 00:06:18.310
Zann shot a glance toward the adults.

101
00:06:19.331 --> 00:06:24.775
Vilkor was still patting his niece on the shoulder, while Zira was watching Zing fly around.

102
00:06:24.795 --> 00:06:29.619
"That's not really a common chupo, is it?"

103
00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:33.642
Zira asked loudly, turning toward Zann and Perda.

104
00:06:34.343 --> 00:06:38.306
"I've never seen nor heard of one that could fly and breathe fire."

105
00:06:39.207 --> 00:06:41.189
Zann gulped, thinking fast.

106
00:06:41.209 --> 00:06:44.812
"Um, maybe the magic from the well gave it new powers?"

107
00:06:45.700 --> 00:06:48.425
"No, I think there's something you're not telling us."

108
00:06:49.446 --> 00:06:55.756
Zira folded her arms over her chest, her steely gaze taking in Zann, Perda, and Zing.

109
00:06:55.776 --> 00:07:00.242
"I think you traveled to Terrica from another world!"
